{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38031","headline":"故都 · 韩偓","name":"故都","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故都遥想草萋萋，上帝深疑亦自迷。\n塞雁已侵池籞宿，宫鸦犹恋女墙啼。\n天涯烈士空垂涕，地下强魂必噬脐。\n掩鼻计成终不觉，冯驩无路斅鸣鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}